#### 5.3 AI Assistant

The AI Assistant is a floating contextual interface.

Reference structure:
- Floating panel on the right side.
- Header containing assistant identity and model information.
- Contextual information section.
- Conversation area.
- Suggested follow-up prompts.
- Message input.
- Send button.
- Minimize and close controls.

Critical behavior:

The assistant must understand the current application context.

